// App icon — the SAME artwork as the mac app (S3, "Xin" white +
// "chào" dark blue). Source: the mac project's
// Resources/AppIcon.icon/Assets/TransPeek.png (1024x1024, opaque).
// Windows cannot use the mac .icon bundle: it needs a .ico file, so the
// PNG was converted once (Pillow) into a multi-size ICO
// (16/32/48/256) and stored here as base64, keeping the repo text-only
// (the connector cannot push binary files). Used for the tray icon
// (System.Drawing.Icon from a stream — no WinRT URI involved) and the
// Settings window title-bar/taskbar icon (written to disk once, see
// TrayIconService.EnsureIconFile).

